WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.040
Hey guys,
We need your help.&nbsp;

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.240
We need good video editors.
So if you are a good video editor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.520
and you want to help us to share the Gospel&nbsp;
effectively to all people in all nations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:15.680
then please reach out to us especially if you're a&nbsp;
mature Christian, because it does help you to edit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.840
the videos better because you understand the Word.
Of course we're not going to know everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.200
because we're all growing in Christ, but if&nbsp;
you pray about it and you know this is what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.280
God wants you to do, then please reach out&nbsp;
to us and use your skills for God's glory.&nbsp;

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.960
Reach out to us today.
If your editing is really good,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:41.160
if God has blessed you with creativity and&nbsp;
speed and effectiveness to share His gospel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:55.320
in a different way, we need you.
Reach out to us today.

